[
  {
    "content_id": "10053001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;保罗、西拉、提摩太写信给帖撒罗尼迦、在　神—我们的父与主耶稣基督里的教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿恩惠、平安从父　神和主耶稣基督归与你们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我们该为你们常常感谢　神，这本是合宜的；因你们的信心格外增长，并且你们众人彼此相爱的心也都充足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;甚至我们在　神的各教会里为你们夸口，都因你们在所受的一切逼迫患难中，仍旧存忍耐和信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;这正是　神公义判断的明证，叫你们可算配得　神的国；你们就是为这国受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;神既是公义的，就必将患难报应那加患难给你们的人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;也必使你们这受患难的人与我们同得平安。那时，主耶稣同他有能力的天使从天上在火焰中显现，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;要报应那不认识　神和那不听从我主耶稣福音的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他们要受刑罚，就是永远沉沦，离开主的面和他权能的荣光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;这正是主降临、要在他圣徒的身上得荣耀、又在一切信的人身上显为希奇的那日子。我们对你们作的见证，你们也信了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因此，我们常为你们祷告，愿我们的　神看你们配得过所蒙的召，又用大能成就你们一切所羡慕的良善和一切因信心所做的工夫，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;叫我们主耶稣的名在你们身上得荣耀，你们也在他身上得荣耀，都照着我们的　神并主耶稣基督的恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，论到我们主耶稣基督降临和我们到他那里聚集，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我劝你们：无论有灵、有言语、有冒我名的书信，说主的日子现在到了，不要轻易动心，也不要惊慌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;人不拘用什么法子，你们总不要被他诱惑；因为那日子以前，必有离道反教的事，并有那大罪人，就是沉沦之子，显露出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他是抵挡主，高抬自己，超过一切称为神的和一切受人敬拜的，甚至坐在　神的殿里，自称是　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我还在你们那里的时候，曾把这些事告诉你们，你们不记得吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;现在你们也知道，那拦阻他的是什么，是叫他到了的时候才可以显露。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为那不法的隐意已经发动，只是现在有一个拦阻的，等到那拦阻的被除去，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那时这不法的人必显露出来。主耶稣要用口中的气灭绝他，用降临的荣光废掉他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;这不法的人来，是照撒但的运动，行各样的异能、神迹，和一切虚假的奇事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;并且在那沉沦的人身上行各样出于不义的诡诈；因他们不领受爱真理的心，使他们得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;故此，　神就给他们一个生发错误的心，叫他们信从虚谎，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;使一切不信真理、倒喜爱不义的人都被定罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;主所爱的弟兄们哪，我们本该常为你们感谢　神；因为他从起初拣选了你们，叫你们因信真道，又被圣灵感动，成为圣洁，能以得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;神借我们所传的福音召你们到这地步，好得着我们主耶稣基督的荣光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;所以，弟兄们，你们要站立得稳，凡所领受的教训，不拘是我们口传的，是信上写的，都要坚守。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但愿我们主耶稣基督和那爱我们、开恩将永远的安慰并美好的盼望赐给我们的父　神，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;安慰你们的心，并且在一切善行善言上坚固你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我还有话说：请你们为我们祷告，好叫主的道理快快行开，得着荣耀，正如在你们中间一样，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;也叫我们脱离无理之恶人的手；因为人不都是有信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;但主是信实的，要坚固你们，保护你们脱离那恶者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我们靠主深信，你们现在是遵行我们所吩咐的，后来也必要遵行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;愿主引导你们的心，叫你们爱　神，并学基督的忍耐！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐你们，凡有弟兄不按规矩而行，不遵守从我们所受的教训，就当远离他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们自己原知道应当怎样效法我们。因为我们在你们中间，未尝不按规矩而行，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;也未尝白吃人的饭，倒是辛苦劳碌，昼夜做工，免得叫你们一人受累。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;这并不是因我们没有权柄，乃是要给你们作榜样，叫你们效法我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我们在你们那里的时候，曾吩咐你们说，若有人不肯做工，就不可吃饭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因我们听说，在你们中间有人不按规矩而行，什么工都不做，反倒专管闲事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我们靠主耶稣基督吩咐、劝戒这样的人，要安静做工，吃自己的饭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，你们行善不可丧志。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;若有人不听从我们这信上的话，要记下他，不和他交往，叫他自觉羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;但不要以他为仇人，要劝他如弟兄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;愿赐平安的主随时随事亲自给你们平安！愿主常与你们众人同在！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我—保罗亲笔问你们安。凡我的信都以此为记，我的笔迹就是这样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;愿我们主耶稣基督的恩常与你们众人同在！</p>"
  }
]